## Reasons for the Errors

The API responded with an "invalid request" error because the Batch job contained several incorrect field names. The corrected Batch job above uses the correct field names as defined in the Batch API documentation.

## Additional Notes

* The `sleep 30 seconds` script will run for 30 seconds.
* The `n2d-highmem-4` machine type has 4 vCPUs and 26 GB of memory.
* The `PREEMPTIBLE` provisioning model indicates that the instances can be preempted by Google Cloud.
* The `CLOUD_LOGGING` destination indicates that the logs will be written to Cloud Logging.

